message: "If this software contributed to a publication, please cite it with its version."
title: "Cyclara: traceable analysis of battery cycling data"
abstract: "Free software (GNU GPL v3 or later) that reads BioLogic EC-Lab files and the text or spreadsheet exports of other battery cyclers and produces journal figures, every table, an Origin folder and a settings record for each analysis. Cyclara is the window of the electrochem-toolkit package."
type: software
authors:
